REQUIRES: libxml2
UNSUPPORTED: system-windows

A setting in windowsSettings has one value. The same setting with the same
value in two manifests is kept once; with two values it is an error.

RUN: llvm-mt /manifest %p/Inputs/heap_type.manifest \
RUN:   /manifest %p/Inputs/heap_type.manifest /out:%t
RUN: FileCheck %s -input-file=%t

CHECK:      <windowsSettings>
CHECK-NEXT:   <heapType xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/SMI/2020/WindowsSettings">SegmentHeap</heapType>
CHECK-NEXT: </windowsSettings>

RUN: not llvm-mt /manifest %p/Inputs/heap_type.manifest \
RUN:   /manifest %p/Inputs/heap_type_nt.manifest /out:%t 2>&1 >/dev/null \
RUN:   | FileCheck --check-prefix=CONFLICT %s

CONFLICT: llvm-mt: error: conflicting values for heapType
